{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06103","headline":"大同殿柱产玉芝龙池上有庆云神光照殿百官共覩圣恩便赐宴乐敢书即事 · 王维","name":"大同殿柱产玉芝龙池上有庆云神光照殿百官共覩圣恩便赐宴乐敢书即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲笑周文歌宴镐，遥轻汉武乐横汾。\n岂知玉殿生三秀，讵有铜池出五云。\n陌上尧樽倾北斗，楼前舜乐动南薰。\n共欢天意同人意，万岁千秋奉圣君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}